### Get the measurements before one exists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/measurements

### Save measurements
POST http://localhost:8080/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measurementDate": "2026-10-31",
  "bodyWeightLbs": 168,
  "neckIn": 13,
  "waistIn": 30
}

### Adding in new measurements
POST http://localhost:8080/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measurementDate": "2026-11-01",
  "bodyWeightLbs": 160,
  "neckIn": 13,
  "waistIn": 30
}

### Listing all measurements
GET http://localhost:8080/api/measurements

### 5. Invalid values
POST http://localhost:8080/api/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measurementDate": "2026-11-10",
  "bodyWeightLbs": -100,
  "neckIn": -3,
  "waistIn": -30
}